{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00290",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.75,
      "end_seconds": 6.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Hi doctor, sorry, the lift was out and I had to take the stairs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.05,
      "end_seconds": 10.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "That's alright, take a seat. Tell me why you've come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.31,
      "end_seconds": 20.87,
      "duration_seconds": 9.56,
      "text": "Yeah, it's pain in my lower back. I don't know what's causing it. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.45,
      "end_seconds": 27.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Right, is this recent, or has it been a while? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.53,
      "end_seconds": 35.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "Since yesterday, that's when it began. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.67,
      "end_seconds": 43.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.68,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.26,
      "end_seconds": 53.31,
      "duration_seconds": 9.05,
      "text": "Moderate, I'd say. Sitting for long and bending definitely sets it off. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.46,
      "end_seconds": 57.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Right, are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.35,
      "end_seconds": 65.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Um, yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.95,
      "end_seconds": 72.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any numbness in the legs, weakness in the legs or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.15,
      "end_seconds": 77.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Yeah, no, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.8,
      "end_seconds": 81.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.76,
      "end_seconds": 84.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.96,
      "end_seconds": 87.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.59,
      "end_seconds": 90.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.26,
      "end_seconds": 93.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "One moment, I'm updating your notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.63,
      "end_seconds": 115.4,
      "duration_seconds": 8.77,
      "text": "That's saved, thanks for waiting. Right, what about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.11,
      "end_seconds": 116.85,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.02,
      "end_seconds": 132.1,
      "duration_seconds": 14.08,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.53,
      "end_seconds": 134.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.96,
      "end_seconds": 138.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Okay, are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.09,
      "end_seconds": 140.07,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Nothing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.89,
      "end_seconds": 143.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.69,
      "end_seconds": 146.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "It's perfect, uh, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.93,
      "end_seconds": 154.32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.16,
      "end_seconds": 167.38,
      "duration_seconds": 12.22,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for about a year. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.35,
      "end_seconds": 172.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Mm-hm. Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.33,
      "end_seconds": 177.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "So, mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.76,
      "end_seconds": 183.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.38,
      "end_seconds": 195.01,
      "duration_seconds": 10.63,
      "text": "Uh, not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.18,
      "end_seconds": 199.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.36,
      "end_seconds": 201.06,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.2,
      "end_seconds": 238.07,
      "duration_seconds": 21.87,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Right, here's what I'm thinking. I think we're dealing with mechanical low back pain at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in your lower back, since yesterday, moderate, and no weight loss or weakness in the legs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.09,
      "end_seconds": 240.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.43,
      "end_seconds": 247.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.32,
      "end_seconds": 262.89,
      "duration_seconds": 14.57,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.36,
      "end_seconds": 291.85,
      "duration_seconds": 27.49,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an X-ray of the lower back for back pain. I'd like you to take thiocolchicoside, 4 milligrams, twice a day, for five days. You take it by mouth. That's for muscle spasm. Every hour, get up and stretch if you're at a desk. Staying gently active heals back pain faster than bed rest, so keep moving. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.2,
      "end_seconds": 308.35,
      "duration_seconds": 16.15,
      "text": "I'd like you to see physiotherapy as well, and I'll write the referral. If you get numbness in the groin or lose bladder control, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Come back in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.83,
      "end_seconds": 315.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Okay, um, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.63,
      "end_seconds": 322.65,
      "duration_seconds": 6.02,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.14,
      "end_seconds": 331.2,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "So, I take the thiocolchicoside, 4 milligrams, twice a day and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.8,
      "end_seconds": 337.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.81,
      "end_seconds": 341.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Well, that's all, thank you for your time."
    }
  ]
}